            <h1 class="article-title mt-2">OCI Card Cancellation: Grounds, Legal Consequences and Legal Remedies</h1>
            <p class="article-subtitle">
                Understand when an OCI card can be cancelled under Indian law, your right to be heard, possible consequences and steps to take after receiving a notice.
            </p>
            <div class="article-meta-row">
                <div class="article-meta-item">
                    <i class="bi bi-person-fill text-gold"></i>
                    <span>RRC Law Associates Legal Editorial Team</span>
                </div>
