                    <span>OCI Legal Guides Series</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Featured Cover Image -->
            <div class="featured-image-wrapper">
                <img src="assets/images/oci-card-cancellation-grounds-remedies.jpg" alt="OCI card cancellation, legal notices and remedies under Indian law" class="featured-image">
                <div class="featured-image-caption">
                    Statutory grounds, procedural rights and legal remedies governing cancellation of OCI registration under Section 7D of the Citizenship Act, 1955.
                </div>
